id":6171,"name":"UTY","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vxemHAgdzVCbvAFcO84MWg2wnXC.png"},{"id":6172,"name":"RCC","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mKslL0MTHHt9ukugWOv3Vh8Tn0E.png"},{"id":6173,"name":"MRT","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/92bKXaygjtTwAbX4AH2UnLJN2Xe.png"},{"id":6174,"name":"ATV","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aawphEBuBGT9RVP6xG3BZV8NOCw.png"},{"id":6175,"name":"MBC","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fVUs2F2qTjOzJ9oP0jeqtpZEAai.png"}],"socialLinks":{"twitter":"https://x.com/hagaren_anime","justwatch":"https://www.justwatch.com/us/tv-show/gang-nolian-jin-shu-shi-fullmetal-alchemist","homepage":"http://www.hagaren.jp/fa/"},"cast":[{"id":81243,"name":"Romi Park","role":"Edward Elric (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fl9vyA3HEkOyTiZBJBhAR3OSmrO.jpg"},{"id":83928,"name":"Rie Kugimiya","role":"Alphonse Elric (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHonhNFpTpz9zCVXLAF7D4OuHLv.jpg"},{"id":62318,"name":"Shin-ichiro Miki","role":"Roy Mustang (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yL9Tx2HZgK7t5AssYl6oGE9bjdj.jpg"},{"id":23988,"name":"Fumiko Orikasa","role":"Riza Hawkeye (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5d1J13fksa1hK8u7AS95aO8b9.jpg"},{"id":589612,"name":"Megumi Takamoto","role":"Winry Rockbell (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gsw7BKhF70wCRDcnwavlz1U4FU.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood","overview":"I fratelli Edward e Alphonse Elric sono due giovani alchimisti. Decisi a trovare un modo per riappropriarsi dei loro corpi originali, saranno costretti a mettere alla prova il loro legame e i loro desideri più e più volte, giungendo a conoscenza di nuovi procedimenti alchemici ed entrando in contatto con misteriosi personaggi decisi a perseguire i propri interessi con ogni mezzo possibile."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood","overview":"Disregard for alchemy’s laws ripped half of Edward Elric’s limbs from his body and left his brother Alphonse’s soul clinging to a suit of armor. To restore what was lost, the brothers seek the Philosopher’s Stone. Enemies and allies – the corrupt military, the Homunculi, and foreign alchemists – will alter the Elric brothers course, but their purpose will remain unchanged and their bond unbreakable.","tagline":"For what could equal the value of a human soul?"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"鋼の錬金術師 FULLMETAL ALCHEMIST","overview":"錬金術、それは「等価交換」の原則のもと、物質を理解、分解、そして再構築する、この世界で最先端の科学である。この錬金術において、最大の“禁忌”とされるもの「人体錬成」。亡き母親を想うがゆえ、禁忌を侵し、全てを失った幼き兄弟。機械鎧（オートメイル）をまとい、「鋼の錬金術師」の名を背負った兄、エドワード・エルリック。巨大な鎧に魂を定着された弟、アルフォンス・エルリック。二人は失ったものを取り戻すため、「賢者の石」を探す旅に出る。兄弟は「賢者の石」の真実に近づくにつれ、大きな陰謀の渦中へと突き進んでいく。暗躍する人ならざる者たちの存在。徐々にその本性をむき出しにする軍事国家アメストリス。虐げられた民の果て無き憎しみと復讐の念。錬金術がもたらす幾多の悲劇。点在する悲劇は、やがて線になり、人を、民を、そして国すらをも巻き込んでいく。兄弟は絶望と希望の狭間の、それでも前に進む--。","tagline":"兄弟は絶望と希望の狭間の中、それでも前に進む…。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1uxD6336yvySlaNqAuCl5XuGt3U.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1uxD6336yvySlaNqAuCl5XuGt3U.png","language":"en","width":963,"height":522},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTTc9LZAgWVcIjpCIt54VvlRIMT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vTTc9LZAgWVcIjpCIt54VvlRIMT.png","language":"en","width":963,"height":522},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMIqyAOrFP1E6lQ9S093KcNgoHK.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gMIqyAOrFP1E6lQ9S093KcNgoHK.png","language":"en","width":963,"height":522},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b1FInsTC02BdjdT07BmZjGO1POS.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b1FInsTC02BdjdT07BmZjGO1POS.png","language":"en","width":549,"height":306},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xQHgLYhvz2tJfFN3MAcCAyWewfO.svg","previewUrl":"